act is saved. Download it for your slides or your desk.", "sub": "One scan <em>saves your contact</em>.<br>Download it", "actions": [{"do": "scroll", "sel": "#qr-canvas", "offset": 150, "ms": 900}, {"do": "point", "sel": "#qr-canvas", "label": "Scan to save", "ms": 1300, "fin": "corner"}, {"do": "scroll", "sel": "#dl-png", "offset": 330, "ms": 800}, {"do": "point", "sel": "#dl-png", "label": "Download PNG"}, {"do": "press", "noclick": true, "ms": 600}]}], "outro": {"title": "Your details never leave your device.", "chips": ["Free", "No sign-up", "Never expires"], "url": "qr.315tools.com", "say": "Free, no sign-up, and your details never leave your device."}}
